                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 5, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Governor Fort and Mr. Smith arrived at Port-au-Prince at 11 this morning. Consul
                    Livingston arrived yesterday morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
